flowchart LR
  %% Runtime: RUN_LAPTOP_RC.bash

  subgraph RUN["RUN_LAPTOP_RC.bash"]
    RVIZ[rviz2]
    JOY[backend/joystick_driver]
    BAG[ros2 bag record (optional)]
  end

  subgraph HW["Robot hardware drivers"]
    DRIVE[drive_motors]
    CONVEYOR[conveyor]
    BUCKET[bucket_spin]
    ARD[arduino_driver]
  end

  RVIZ -->|subscribes for visualization  - camera/TF/map - | ROS[ - ROS graph - ]
  JOY -->|publishes cmd/velocity  - teleop drive -  to| DRIVE
  JOY -->|publishes cmd/conveyor  - teleop -  to| CONVEYOR
  JOY -->|publishes cmd/bucket_vel  - teleop -  to| BUCKET
  JOY -->|publishes /cmd/bucket_pos  - teleop -  to| ARD
  JOY -->|publishes /cmd/pan  - teleop camera pan -  to| ARD
  JOY -->|publishes /cmd/camera_height  - teleop camera height -  to| ARD

  BAG -->|records /odom /camera /depth /points  - rosbag capture -  to| ROS
